'''Halloween Costumes Skin Pack'''<ref>{{Cite|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20151030024206/https://mojang.com/2015/10/halloween-skins-coming-to-pocket-and-windows-10/|title=Halloween skins coming to Pocket and Windows 10|author=Owen Hill|date=October 23, 2015|website=[[Mojang.com]]}}</ref> is a skin pack that includes 15 skins themed by being dressed up for Halloween.

